  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 2 parts x 5 years = 10 as printed. 同 expanded in year labels. Layout: the printed table is stacked in two column blocks per part (營業別 總數/農林業/商業/商業並運輸業 above; 水產業/工業/鑛業/拓殖業/其ノ他 and 組織別 below); joined here into one row per year. Part 2 heading printed as 南洋ニ本社ヲ (end of first block) + 設クル會社 (再掲) (second block).",
   "Small 円 marks above the first row in each money column = unit 圓.",
   "Checks (all reconcile): for every year in both parts, 社數 of the nine sectors sum to the 總數 社數 and to the 組織別 總社數; 株式+合資+合名 sum to 總社數; 公稱資本 and 拂込資本 of the sectors sum to the 總數 figures.",
   "Printed misprints kept: part 2 昭和 8 商業 公稱資本 '10,41,500' (the totals reconcile with 1,041,500); part 2 昭和 12 總數 公稱資本 '95.991.517' (periods for commas).",
   "Part 1 昭和 12 其ノ他 prints dashes in all three columns; 鑛業 and 拓殖業 dash before first appearance.",
   "Printed errata slip (正誤表, pasted in at the front), p. 111, table 141, 昭和八年商業公稱資本南洋ニ本社ヲ設クル會社: printed '10,41,500' should read '1,041,500'. The figure is kept as printed in this table."
